{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫處境劇《愛‧回家之三代同糖》今晚（29日）播出新一集，講述嘉冰（車婉婉飾）與龔喜（樊亦敏飾）以為獲得賞識受邀擔任直播主，未料誤墮騙局，遭幕後老闆Brain（唐嘉麟飾）強迫販售假貨。</p><p>唐芯（李茵彤飾）、嘉聰（李偉健飾）及朱基（歐瑞偉飾）觀看直播時察覺異樣，遂趕往現場營救。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T06:21:09.305789+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T05:36:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T12:38:14.753867+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T06:18:11.382387+00:00","content_hash":"a29f9350422cded6a844af746b775211beff28062dcfe8e492fe87213d70d75c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}